    "13巡で1手が終わり、点を合計します。だれかが50点に届いた手で終了し、合計の少ない人が勝ちです" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A hand ends after 13 tricks and points are added up. The game ends when someone reaches 50 points, and the lowest total wins"
          }
        }
      }
    },
